    <bpmn:process id="W_W1646" name="W1646. Annual Budget Preparation &amp; Bottoms-Up Forecasting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Board-approved strategic priorities from W1645
Frequency: Annual (October–December for following year)
Volume: 1 consolidated budget covering 5 entities, 200 stores, 4 DCs, HQ
Owner: CFO
Participants: CFO, FP&amp;A, all department heads, Store Operations, VP Supply Chain
Source: workflow W1646 — Annual Budget Preparation &amp; Bottoms-Up Forecasting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1646_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1646_Lane1" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1646_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1646_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1646_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1646_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1646_Lane2" name="Category Managers">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1646_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1646_Lane3" name="All department heads">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1646_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1646_Lane4" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1646_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1646_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1646_Start6" name="Board-approved strategic priorities from W1645">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1646_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1646_Task7" name="CFO distributes budget guidelines and templates: (a) top-level targets from…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CFO distributes budget guidelines and templates: (a) top-level targets from strategic plan (revenue growth, EBITDA margin, store count), (b) budget assumptions: inflation rate (Philippine CPI ~4–6%), wage increase guidance (~5–8%), peso-dollar exchange rate assumption, interest rate assumption, (c) budget templates: revenue by store/category/channel, COGS by category, OpEx by department, capex by project, headcount by department, working capital assumptions
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1646_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1646_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1646_Task8" name="Bottoms-up revenue forecasting: (a) existing stores: Category Managers forecast…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Bottoms-up revenue forecasting: (a) existing stores: Category Managers forecast category-level revenue growth per store cluster based on historical trends, planned promotions, competitive activity, (b) new stores: Store Operations provides planned opening schedule and ramp-up revenue curve (Month 1: 50% of target; Month 3: 75%; Month 6: 90%; Month 12: 100%), (c) ecommerce: CMO forecasts ecommerce growth from ~3% to target penetration (~5%), (d) FP&amp;A consolidates into total revenue forecast by entity, store, channel, and category
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Store Operations / CMO / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 3 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1646_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1646_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1646_Task9" name="Cost budgeting: (a) COGS: Category Managers forecast category margin…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Cost budgeting: (a) COGS: Category Managers forecast category margin assumptions (commodity prices, vendor negotiations, private label expansion), (b) Store OpEx: Store Operations forecasts per-store operating costs (rent, utilities, maintenance), (c) DC/logistics cost: VP Supply Chain forecasts distribution cost per unit, (d) HQ OpEx: department heads forecast operating expenses, (e) Payroll: CHRO forecasts total compensation cost including planned wage increases and headcount changes, (f) IT: CIO forecasts technology spend (infrastructure, licenses, projects), (g) Marketing: CMO forecasts marketing spend by channel
Responsible (R): All department heads
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 3 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1646_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1646_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1646_Task10" name="FP&amp;A consolidates all departmental budgets into enterprise model: (a) projected…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: FP&amp;A consolidates all departmental budgets into enterprise model: (a) projected P&amp;L by entity and consolidated, (b) projected balance sheet (working capital, capex, debt), (c) projected cash flow, (d) sensitivity analysis (best case, base case, worst case for key assumptions: revenue growth, inflation, exchange rate, interest rate)
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1646_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1646_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1646_Task11" name="CFO reviews consolidated budget; iterates with department heads on gaps: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: CFO reviews consolidated budget; iterates with department heads on gaps: (a) budget vs. strategic target alignment, (b) margin improvement opportunities, (c) cost reduction options, (d) capex prioritization (if total capex request exceeds affordability)
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1646_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1646_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1646_Task12" name="Final budget package prepared for Board approval per W1650">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Final budget package prepared for Board approval per W1650
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1646_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1646_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1646_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1646_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1646_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-340 (ensure controlled execution — Annual Business Planning &amp; Budgeting (PA-33.1).) | - operational: CFO review and approval gate
Owner: CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1646_Assoc15" sourceRef="W1646_Annotation14" targetRef="W1646_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1646_Flow16" sourceRef="W1646_Start6" targetRef="W1646_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1646_Flow17" sourceRef="W1646_Task7" targetRef="W1646_Task8" />
