    <bpmn:process id="W_W1647" name="W1647. Store-Level Annual Target Setting &amp; P&amp;L Budget Allocation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget process (W1646)
Frequency: Annual (November–December)
Volume: 200 stores + 4 DCs
Owner: VP Store Operations
Participants: VP Store Operations, Regional Managers, Store Managers, FP&amp;A
Source: workflow W1647 — Store-Level Annual Target Setting &amp; P&amp;L Budget Allocation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1647_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1647_Lane1" name="VP Store Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1647_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1647_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1647_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1647_Lane2" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1647_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1647_Lane3" name="Regional Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1647_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1647_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1647_Start5" name="Annual budget process (W1646)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1647_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1647_Task6" name="VP Store Operations and FP&amp;A develop store-level P&amp;L budget template: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Store Operations and FP&amp;A develop store-level P&amp;L budget template: (a) revenue target by category (based on store size, location, maturity, competitive landscape), (b) gross margin target by category, (c) controllable expenses: payroll, utilities, maintenance, supplies, shrinkage, (d) non-controllable expenses: rent, allocated HQ costs
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1647_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1647_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1647_Task7" name="Revenue target allocation to stores: (a) base: current year run-rate with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Revenue target allocation to stores: (a) base: current year run-rate with adjustments for: (i) new competitive openings/closures in trade area, (ii) category mix shifts, (iii) planned promotional calendar impact, (iv) maturity curve for stores &lt; 3 years old, (b) stretch target: +5–10% above base for incentive compensation calculation
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A / VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1647_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1647_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1647_Task8" name="Regional Managers review store-level targets with Store Managers: (a) Store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Regional Managers review store-level targets with Store Managers: (a) Store Manager provides local market intelligence (construction activity in area, competitor pricing, barangay events), (b) adjustments made for store-specific factors, (c) Store Manager commits to revenue and controllable expense targets
Responsible (R): Regional Manager / Store Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 30 min/store</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1647_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1647_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1647_Task9" name="Store-level budgets consolidated into Store Operations P&amp;L; VP Store Operations…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Store-level budgets consolidated into Store Operations P&amp;L; VP Store Operations and CFO review and approve
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations / CFO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1647_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1647_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1647_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1647_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1647_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-230 (ensure strategy-to-budget alignment.) | - operational: VP Store Operations review and approval gate
Owner: VP Store Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
