    <bpmn:process id="W_W1648" name="W1648. Capital Expenditure Budget Planning &amp; Prioritization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget process (W1646)
Frequency: Annual with quarterly reviews
Volume: ~10–15 new store builds + ~20–30 existing store renovation projects + IT capex + DC expansion
Owner: CFO
Participants: CFO, COO, CIO, VP Supply Chain, VP Store Operations, Board
Source: workflow W1648 — Capital Expenditure Budget Planning &amp; Prioritization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1648_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1648_Lane1" name="All department heads">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1648_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1648_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1648_Lane2" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1648_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1648_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1648_Lane3" name="Board">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1648_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1648_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1648_Start5" name="Annual budget process (W1646)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1648_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1648_Task6" name="Department heads submit capex requests: (a) Store Operations — new store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Department heads submit capex requests: (a) Store Operations — new store construction (~10–15/year × ~PHP 40–60M per store = ~PHP 400–900M), store renovations and refresh, (b) VP Supply Chain — DC expansion, automation equipment, fleet additions, (c) CIO — IT infrastructure, software licenses, development projects, (d) CHRO — office renovation, training facilities, (e) CFO — financial systems, office equipment
Responsible (R): All department heads
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1648_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1648_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1648_Task7" name="CFO and FP&amp;A evaluate capex requests: (a) financial evaluation: IRR, NPV…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CFO and FP&amp;A evaluate capex requests: (a) financial evaluation: IRR, NPV, payback period for each project, (b) strategic alignment: maps to approved strategic priorities per W1645, (c) affordability: total capex vs. available capital (retained earnings + debt capacity), (d) prioritization matrix: strategic importance vs. financial return
Responsible (R): CFO / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1648_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1648_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1648_Task8" name="Capex prioritization review with CEO and COO: (a) mandatory capex (store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Capex prioritization review with CEO and COO: (a) mandatory capex (store openings committed in lease agreements, regulatory compliance, safety), (b) growth capex (new stores, DC expansion, technology), (c) maintenance capex (renovations, replacements), (d) discretionary capex (nice-to-have projects)
Responsible (R): CFO / CEO / COO
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1648_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1648_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1648_Task9" name="Board approves annual capex budget with project-level authorization thresholds…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Board approves annual capex budget with project-level authorization thresholds: (a) &lt; PHP 1M: CFO approval, (b) PHP 1–10M: CEO approval, (c) PHP 10–50M: Board committee approval, (d) &gt; PHP 50M: full Board approval
Responsible (R): Board
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Board meeting</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1648_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1648_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1648_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1648_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1648_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-230 (ensure strategy-to-budget alignment.) | - operational: CFO review and approval gate
Owner: CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
