    <bpmn:process id="W_W1649" name="W1649. Department Annual Operating Plan Development" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Budget approval and strategic priorities cascade
Frequency: Annual (December–January)
Volume: ~15 department operating plans
Owner: Department Heads
Participants: All department heads, C-Suite
Source: workflow W1649 — Department Annual Operating Plan Development</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1649_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1649_Lane1" name="Department Head">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1649_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1649_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1649_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1649_Lane2" name="Department Heads">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1649_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1649_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1649_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1649_Start4" name="Budget approval and strategic priorities cascade">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1649_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1649_Task5" name="Each department head develops annual operating plan: (a) key initiatives…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Each department head develops annual operating plan: (a) key initiatives (aligned to strategic priorities), (b) quarterly milestones and deliverables, (c) resource requirements (headcount, budget, technology), (d) risks and mitigation plans, (e) KPIs and targets, (f) cross-functional dependencies
Responsible (R): Department Head
Accountable (A): C-Suite sponsor
Duration: 1 week/department</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1649_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1649_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1649_Task6" name="Department heads present operating plan to C-Suite in 30-minute sessions…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Department heads present operating plan to C-Suite in 30-minute sessions; C-Suite reviews: (a) alignment to strategy, (b) resource feasibility, (c) cross-functional coordination requirements, (d) risk mitigation adequacy
Responsible (R): Department Head
Accountable (A): C-Suite
Duration: 30 min/department</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1649_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1649_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1649_Task7" name="Cross-functional dependencies identified and resolved: (a) new store opening…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Cross-functional dependencies identified and resolved: (a) new store opening timeline requires HR (staffing), IT (systems), Supply Chain (stocking), Marketing (grand opening), (b) ecommerce feature launch requires IT (development), Merchandising (product content), Marketing (promotion)
Responsible (R): Department Heads / C-Suite
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1649_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1649_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1649_Task8" name="Final operating plans documented and distributed; KPIs entered into performance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Final operating plans documented and distributed; KPIs entered into performance management system
Responsible (R): Department Heads
Accountable (A): C-Suite
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1649_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1649_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1649_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1649_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1649_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-340 (ensure controlled execution — Annual Business Planning &amp; Budgeting (PA-33.1).) | - operational: Department Heads review and approval gate
Owner: Department Heads</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
