    <bpmn:process id="W_W1650" name="W1650. Budget Approval, Board Presentation &amp; Communication" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Final budget package completed (W1646)
Frequency: Annual (December Board meeting)
Volume: 1 consolidated budget
Owner: CFO
Participants: CFO, CEO, Board of Directors
Source: workflow W1650 — Budget Approval, Board Presentation &amp; Communication</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1650_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1650_Lane1" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1650_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1650_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1650_Lane2" name="CEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1650_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1650_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1650_Lane3" name="Board">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1650_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1650_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1650_Start5" name="Final budget package completed (W1646)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1650_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1650_Task6" name="CFO prepares Board budget presentation: (a) executive summary: key targets…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CFO prepares Board budget presentation: (a) executive summary: key targets, strategic initiatives, major changes from current year, (b) P&amp;L summary: revenue, gross margin, OpEx, EBITDA, net income by entity and consolidated, (c) balance sheet and cash flow summary, (d) capex plan with project-level detail and ROI analysis, (e) sensitivity analysis (best/base/worst case), (f) key risks and mitigations, (g) headcount plan and payroll cost
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1650_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1650_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1650_Task7" name="CEO and CFO present budget to Board; Board reviews and provides feedback…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CEO and CFO present budget to Board; Board reviews and provides feedback; typical Board questions: (a) revenue growth assumptions vs. macroeconomic outlook, (b) margin improvement credibility (what specific initiatives drive margin improvement?), (c) capex return assumptions, (d) working capital management, (e) competitive risk, (f) contingency planning
Responsible (R): CEO / CFO
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: 2–3 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1650_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1650_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1650_Task8" name="Board approves budget (with or without modifications); CFO distributes approved…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Board approves budget (with or without modifications); CFO distributes approved budget to department heads; department heads align operating plans to approved budget
Responsible (R): Board / CFO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1650_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1650_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1650_Task9" name="Communication to organization: (a) CEO communicates strategic priorities and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Communication to organization: (a) CEO communicates strategic priorities and high-level targets to all employees (town hall or video message), (b) C-Suite communicates department-specific targets to their teams, (c) Store Managers receive store-level P&amp;L targets per W1647
Responsible (R): CEO / C-Suite
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1650_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1650_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1650_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1650_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1650_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-230 (ensure strategy-to-budget alignment.) | - operational: CFO review and approval gate
Owner: CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1650_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1650_Annotation11" targetRef="W1650_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
